{"version":1,"content":"\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261028%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9C%E5%A5%B3%E5%AD%90%E6%B6%89%E6%97%BA%E8%A7%92%E8%A1%97%E9%A0%AD%E9%81%BA%E6%A3%84%E5%B9%BC%E7%8A%AC%E8%A2%AB%E6%8E%A7-%E9%82%84%E6%9F%99%E5%B0%8F%E6%AC%96%E7%9C%8B%E7%AE%A1-%E5%BE%85%E7%B4%A2%E5%A0%B1%E5%91%8A%E4%BB%A5%E6%AA%A2%E8%A6%96%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E9%81%A9%E5%90%88%E7%AD%94%E8%BE%AF-819x1024.jpg\" width=\"819\"/></figure>\n<p><strong>一隻幼犬今年5月被遺棄在旺角黑布街104號後巷，28歲女子被控一項「殘酷對待動物」罪，案件今（28日）在西九龍裁判法院首度提堂。案件押後至11月11日，其間索取兩份精神科報告，以檢視被告是否適合答辯，被告須還柙小欖精神病治療中心。</strong></p>\n<p>\n<p><a href=\"https://linktr.ee/hkcourtnews\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">訂閱《庭刊》</a></p>\n</p>\n<p>被告陳凱晴（28歲，無業）被控於今年5月9日，在旺角黑布街104號利豐大廈後巷殘酷地惡待一隻幼犬，導致該幼犬受到不必要的痛苦。</p>\n<p>法院：西九龍裁判法院<br/>被告：陳凱晴<br/>控罪：殘酷對待動物<br/>案件編號：WKCC5134/2026</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://qr.payme.hsbc.com.hk/2/QrndvPxDgEi2MhNiNPz4b8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"916\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9CHKCourtNews_PayMe_QR_code.png\" width=\"716\"/></a></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/hkcourtnews_Octopus_QRcode_Payment_v4.png\" width=\"1080\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<p><strong>如欲接收每日報道整合，請在訊息欄內填寫電郵地址</strong></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T11:41:47.354537+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":257,"images":3,"source":"法庭線","fallback":"rss-http-error","origin":"wordpress-public-posts","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T11:35:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T11:38:14.781493+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T11:38:14.781493+00:00","content_hash":"431e2f4d5bb61bae5bbad6401ad26e3840cd0c820cdb6e910917dc2dcc8b0d1e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HT